etup-node action to v7 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/459\n* Update module github.com/montanaflynn/stats to v0.12.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/458\n* Update dependency typescript to v7 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/457\n* Update module github.com/klauspost/compress to v1.19.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/462\n* Update dependency @bufbuild/protobuf to v2.13.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/463\n* Update module github.com/klauspost/compress to v1.19.2 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/466\n* Update module google.golang.org/protobuf to v1.36.12 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/469\n* Update module github.com/montanaflynn/stats to v0.12.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/470\n* Update dependency @bufbuild/protobuf to v2.14.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/471\n* Update module github.com/urfave/cli/v3 to v3.11.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/473\n* Update module github.com/stretchr/testify to v1.12.0 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/474\n* Update module github.com/montanaflynn/stats to v0.12.4 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/476\n* Update module github.com/stretchr/testify to v1.12.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/477\n* Replace CSC review workflow with `CODEOWNERS` by @jupblb in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/472\n* Update actions/setup-java action to v6 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/478\n* Update module github.com/montanaflynn/stats to v0.12.5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/479\n* Update dependency @bufbuild/protobuf to v2.14.1 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/scip-code/scip/pull/480\n* Allow auto-merging Renovate PRs by @jupblb